  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nGiven: \n\n(8, 38, 11)\n\n__**(8 + 11)**__ × 2 = 38\n\n__**19**____** × 2**__ = 38\n\n38 = 38 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(3, 20, 7)\n\n__(3 + 7)__ × 2 = 20\n\n__10____ × 2__ = 20\n\n20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each question one by one:\n\nOption 1) (2, 52, 32)\n\n__(2 + 32)__ × 2 = 52\n\n__34____ × 2__ = 52\n\n68 ≠ 38 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) (1, 26, 12)\n\n__(1 + 12)__ × 2 = 26\n\n__13____ × 2__ = 26\n\n**26 = 26 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) (4, 14, 2)\n\n__(4 + 2)__ × 2 = 14\n\n__6____ × 2__ = 14\n\n12 ≠ 14 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (3, 20, 5)\n\n__(3 + 5)__ × 2 = 20\n\n__8____ × 2__ = 20\n\n16 ≠ 20 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options '(1, 26, 12)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
